        "problem": "For which points does the function $y=f(x)$ below have a point discontinuity?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040337/assets/10ba0496a4dc42579bb95d371a65d808edc0cc5a5653ab3e23d4fe85adf90518.png)",
